---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CLI as ctxt CLI
    participant JobStore as Job Store (SQLite)
    participant Worker as Background Worker
    participant Pipeline
    participant LocalDB as Local Storage

    Note over User,LocalDB: Job Lifecycle Flow

    User->>CLI: ctxt analyze "https://example.com"

    CLI->>CLI: Parse input<br/>Infer type: url.generic

    CLI->>JobStore: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    CLI->>JobStore: INSERT INTO jobs<br/>(job_id, status='pending',<br/>payload, pipeline='url.generic')
    CLI->>JobStore: COMMIT
    JobStore-->>CLI: Job created: job-1234

    CLI-->>User: ✓ Queued for analysis<br/>(job-1234)

    Note over Worker: Worker polling loop

    Worker->>JobStore: SELECT * FROM jobs<br/>WHERE status='pending'<br/>ORDER BY created_at<br/>LIMIT 1 FOR UPDATE

    JobStore-->>Worker: Job job-1234

    Worker->>JobStore: UPDATE jobs<br/>SET status='running',<br/>locked_at=NOW()

    Worker->>Pipeline: Execute pipeline('url.generic', payload)
    activate Pipeline

    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Task 1: Fetch URL
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Task 2: Extract metadata
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Task 3: Mention extraction
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Task 4: Tag alignment
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Task 5: Entity resolution

    alt Pipeline succeeds
        Pipeline-->>Worker: Bookmark data
        Worker->>LocalDB: INSERT INTO bookmarks
        Worker->>JobStore: UPDATE jobs<br/>SET status='completed'
    else Pipeline fails (retryable)
        Pipeline-->>Worker: Error: network timeout
        Worker->>JobStore: UPDATE jobs<br/>SET status='pending',<br/>retry_count=retry_count+1
    else Pipeline fails (permanent)
        Pipeline-->>Worker: Error: invalid URL
        Worker->>JobStore: UPDATE jobs<br/>SET status='failed',<br/>error='invalid URL'
    end

    deactivate Pipeline

    Note over Worker: Continue polling for next job
```
